    <briefdescription>
<para>Device-safe view into the full block matrix structure. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Values are interleaved by CSR position: at each of the nnz non-zero positions, an nBlocks x nBlocks column-major coupling matrix is stored. operator()(k) returns the <ref refid="structNeoN_1_1la_1_1BlockView" kindref="compound">BlockView</ref> at CSR position k. rowView(k, startRow, endRow) returns a rectangular <ref refid="structNeoN_1_1la_1_1BlockRowView" kindref="compound">BlockRowView</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
